   "en": "Konishi was an ordinary man, until a series of misfortunes led him to find himself without a job, without a girlfriend, without money and without a home. When he was already convinced that he had no choice but to live on the street, his path crosses that of Yukine, the arrogant, spoiled and capricious son of the president of one of the largest companies in the country, who decides to keep him as a butler."
